  "body": "An exceptional opportunity to create your dream coastal residence on the prestigious seaward side of Takapuna, just an easy three-minute walk from the beach.\r\n\r\n*Property Files (Copy and paste the link below to view or download the property documents):\r\nhttps://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG36171\r\n**All agent conjunctionals welcome!\r\n\r\nPositioned on an elevated, sun-soaked 615m2 (approx.) freehold site with a desirable northerly aspect, this property presents an exciting opportunity for visionary families, executives and discerning buyers seeking a premium lifestyle in one of Takapuna's most tightly held locations.\r\n\r\nThe hard work has already been done!!! With Resource Consent (RC), Building Consent (BC) and Engineering Plan Approval (EPA) in place, the approved plans offer an impressive three-level standalone luxury residence with a total floor area of 543m2, including 103m2 of balconies.\r\n\r\nThe approved luxury residence features:\r\n- Impressive 543m2 total floor area, including 103m2 of balconies\r\n- Five generous bedrooms and four bathrooms\r\n- Three levels of spacious luxury living\r\n- Private elevator for effortless accessibility\r\n- Double internal-access garage\r\n- Private swimming pool for resort-style enjoyment\r\n- Two legal road frontage access points\r\n\r\nBuild your dream, renovate or landbank - the choice is yours.\r\n\r\nThe existing charming 1920s character bungalow offers another appealing opportunity. Featuring four bedrooms, two bathrooms, two spacious living areas, high ceilings, stained-glass windows, original character details and multiple French doors opening onto the verandah and garden, the home offers excellent potential for renovation, comfortable family living or rental income while future plans take shape.\r\n\r\nThe generous garden provides wonderful outdoor space for children, family gatherings and entertaining.\r\n\r\nA lifestyle location that's hard to beat!!! \r\n\r\nEnjoy an easy three-minute walk to Takapuna Beach, with Takapuna's vibrant cafes, restaurants, boutique shopping and everyday amenities all close by. Convenient access to Esmonde Road makes commuting to Auckland CBD straightforward.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the sought-after school zones, including Hauraki School, Takapuna School, Belmont Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School and Westlake Girls High School.\r\n\r\nPremium coastal positioning, substantial freehold land and approved plans for an extraordinary luxury residence - opportunities like this are rarely available.\r\n\r\nWhether your vision is to create a landmark family residence, transform a character home or secure a strategic investment for the future, 10 Ewen Street offers the location, flexibility and potential to make it happen.\r\n\r\nBring your vision to life. Contact Lei Li today to explore this exceptional opportunity.",
